     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I proposed this as part of a larger goal of generalizing the kernel-api, etc for use with alternate implementations. I no longer have that as a goal, and so I see no need to pursue this issue.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
