  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The package structure in the core fcrepo-* modules contain a number of circular dependencies. These can be seen here: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://sonar.fcrepo.org/design/index/org.fcrepo:fcrepo"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://sonar.fcrepo.org/design/index/org.fcrepo:fcrepo",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This affects fcrepo-kernel-api to a small degree and fcrepo-kernel-modeshape to a large degree. This task is to propose a better structure and organization of these modules and will likely result in renaming and/or consolidating certain packages.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A document for discussing this proposal can be found here: ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MhgircKQWOLCrj9xWBStY0YAPYclt6EmQu3wn4_Pp2Y/edit?usp=sharing"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1MhgircKQWOLCrj9xWBStY0YAPYclt6EmQu3wn4_Pp2Y/edit?usp=sharing",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
